// DUE-006 [2026-10-09] The Boot damage -40% -> -60% at all levels (DUE-004 baseline superseded). User judged it overpowered in play: stun + push + stance swap on a 95-115 accuracy kick.
// DUE-004 [2026-10-06] Restore The Boot to vanilla damage -40% at all five levels for the user-requested baseline; supersedes DUE-001/002/003. Original control, movement and stance remain.
// DUE-003 [current 2026-10-05] Restore The Boot damage -70% -> -60% at all levels; retain forward movement and precise stance-based control. Supersedes DUE-002.
// DUE-001 DUE-002 [trace 2026-10-05] Pay for higher accuracy and reliable push with lower damage while retaining stun and stance.
// DUE-002 The Boot damage -60% -> -70% at all levels; accuracy, crit, stun, push and stance retained. Previous change: DUE-001.
// DUE-008 the_boot: 1렙 명중 95 -> 90(피해 있는 기절 명중 90 기준). 피해 -60% 유지 [제작자]
// DUE-009 the_boot: 1렙 명중 90 -> 95 되돌림(DUE-008 취소) [제작자]

